    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/494ad9e1339fcf5e2773b0011c4fdd32.avif?t=1753353111\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A vertical platformer \u201crage game\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In **Wise in the Heights** you play as a sage apprentice climbing an endless mountain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >charging each jump by holding the button. One mistake can send you tumbling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dozens of screens down.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints, no shortcuts, only one promise: the summit is always reachable!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  Inspired by classics such as *Jump King* and *Getting Over It*.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  \u201cEasy to learn, hard to master\u201d gameplay: move and jump\u2014pulling it off is another story!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  Three difficulty modes that change the trivia questions gating your progress.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  150+ general-knowledge questions (ES / EN) shuffled every run.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  Retro pixel-art visuals with landscapes that evolve as you climb.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  Immersive chiptune soundtrack and 16-bit SFX.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022  Timer, jump counter and final stats to brag \u2014or cry\u2014 about with friends.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why it will frustrate (and hook) you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall is not a game over but a lesson.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll learn to gauge perfect power, read wind patterns and keep calm when a single pixel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >separates glory from disaster. When you finally reach the top, you\u2019ll know you did it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**through skill and sheer persistence**.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Main Menu  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/89ceda33af915d7cb4475cf7be91b3f1.avif?t=1753353111\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Choose Difficult</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/f349f5c4073e234e454e4f31432a54ab.avif?t=1753353111\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > In game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/30baca4ed3f2fcf4365f33ffc44cf059.avif?t=1753353111\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Example Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/7c846310072ef112f3431fcda668d25d.poster.avif?t=1753353111\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/7c846310072ef112f3431fcda668d25d.webm?t=1753353111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/7c846310072ef112f3431fcda668d25d.mp4?t=1753353111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Example of a Good Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860020/extras/b3e6bd17785b6352ee635a2f257c73d8.poster.avif?t=1753353111\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://